    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u201cTHE SUPER SPACE SNIPER COMES. NOBODY CAN SURVIVE.\u201d</h2><br>Toaplan\u2019s Out Zone is back in action and reloaded with modern features, like online leaderboards, arcade-accurate emulation, quick saves, and the brand-new beginner mode. As one of the most celebrated run and gun shooters in arcade history, its hellish challenges will get your blood pumping if you have the skills to match! <br><br>Countless alien invasions of Earth have left humankind on the verge of extinction. You must plunge headfirst into battle as a world-class cyborg mercenary in a last-ditch effort to overthrow the alien threat!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022920/extras/7c33467263e99ee3bd885eea0a47929b.poster.avif?t=1747301486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022920/extras/7c33467263e99ee3bd885eea0a47929b.webm?t=1747301486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022920/extras/7c33467263e99ee3bd885eea0a47929b.mp4?t=1747301486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ORIGINAL GAME FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Run and gun your way through hordes of enemies in this vertical shoot 'em up!<br></li><li>Go at it solo, or join forces with a buddy in co-op mode!<br></li><li>Master a unique weapon system with omnidirectional lasers, straight-shooting shotguns, and special weapons like the Super Burner and the Super Ball to obliterate the alien attackers!<br></li><li>Stay alive and alert by keeping an eye on your constantly depleting battery!<br></li><li>Feel your heart pump to Tatsuya Uemura's original soundtrack!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022920/extras/44a9106930699f93fdef4c10510ad9c1.poster.avif?t=1747301486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022920/extras/44a9106930699f93fdef4c10510ad9c1.webm?t=1747301486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022920/extras/44a9106930699f93fdef4c10510ad9c1.mp4?t=1747301486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">QUALITY OF LIFE IMPROVEMENTS:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Minimal Input Lag: Emulation, input processing, and rendering all complete on the same frame.<br></li><li>Quick Save using F1-F10, Reload with Shift+ F1-F10<br></li><li>Online leaderboards for Single Credit, No Assist, and Assisted plays.<br></li><li>Instrument panels with extra gameplay information and artwork.<br></li><li>Rewind the game between 10-18 minutes, depending on the action.<br></li><li>Capture sharable replays to immortalize your interstellar victories (or funny moments).<br></li><li>Assist Features such as auto-fire at multiple rates.<br></li><li>Very Easy Mode: Lower the difficulty to breeze through the adventure.<br></li><li>Pixel perfect or full-screen scaling in windowed or full-screen mode.<br></li><li>Rotate the gameplay in 90-degree increments. <br></li><li>Steam Achievements<br></li><li>Choose between Raw Input on Windows or Steam Input.<br></li><li>Hone your skills in the ultra-customizable practice mode!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u201cTHE SUPER SPACE SNIPER COMES. NOBODY CAN SURVIVE.\u201d</h2><br>Toaplan\u2019s Out Zone is back in action and reloaded with modern features, like online leaderboards, arcade-accurate emulation, quick saves, and the brand-new beginner mode. As one of the most celebrated run and gun shooters in arcade history, its hellish challenges will get your blood pumping if you have the skills to match! <br><br>Countless alien invasions of Earth have left humankind on the verge of extinction. You must plunge headfirst into battle as a world-class cyborg mercenary in a last-ditch effort to overthrow the alien threat!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022920/extras/7c33467263e99ee3bd885eea0a47929b.poster.avif?t=1747301486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022920/extras/7c33467263e99ee3bd885eea0a47929b.webm?t=1747301486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022920/extras/7c33467263e99ee3bd885eea0a47929b.mp4?t=1747301486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ORIGINAL GAME FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Run and gun your way through hordes of enemies in this vertical shoot 'em up!<br></li><li>Go at it solo, or join forces with a buddy in co-op mode!<br></li><li>Master a unique weapon system with omnidirectional lasers, straight-shooting shotguns, and special weapons like the Super Burner and the Super Ball to obliterate the alien attackers!<br></li><li>Stay alive and alert by keeping an eye on your constantly depleting battery!<br></li><li>Feel your heart pump to Tatsuya Uemura's original soundtrack!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022920/extras/44a9106930699f93fdef4c10510ad9c1.poster.avif?t=1747301486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022920/extras/44a9106930699f93fdef4c10510ad9c1.webm?t=1747301486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022920/extras/44a9106930699f93fdef4c10510ad9c1.mp4?t=1747301486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">QUALITY OF LIFE IMPROVEMENTS:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Minimal Input Lag: Emulation, input processing, and rendering all complete on the same frame.<br></li><li>Quick Save using F1-F10, Reload with Shift+ F1-F10<br></li><li>Online leaderboards for Single Credit, No Assist, and Assisted plays.<br></li><li>Instrument panels with extra gameplay information and artwork.<br></li><li>Rewind the game between 10-18 minutes, depending on the action.<br></li><li>Capture sharable replays to immortalize your interstellar victories (or funny moments).<br></li><li>Assist Features such as auto-fire at multiple rates.<br></li><li>Very Easy Mode: Lower the difficulty to breeze through the adventure.<br></li><li>Pixel perfect or full-screen scaling in windowed or full-screen mode.<br></li><li>Rotate the gameplay in 90-degree increments. <br></li><li>Steam Achievements<br></li><li>Choose between Raw Input on Windows or Steam Input.<br></li><li>Hone your skills in the ultra-customizable practice mode!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Blast through alien hordes as the finest cyborg mercenary in existence! To emerge victorious, you'll need to manage time and resources skillfully. Toaplan's run-and-gun smash-hit finally arrives on PC, reloaded with new features and quality-of-life extras!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cA beautifully preserved slice of video game history\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 The Guardian<br><br>\u201cBitwave has capably brought Western gamers four important, sometimes overlooked gems that play a pivotal role in arcade history\u201d<br>Eurogamer<br><br>\u201cWith accurate emulation, impressive quality of life features, and a slew of difficulty options to tailor the experience to one\u2019s liking, it\u2019s difficult to find many negatives in the first volume of Bitwave\u2019s Toaplan Arcade Shoot \u2018Em Up Collection\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Gamer Escape<br>",
